{"type":"npc","name":"Necrosis Engine","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":170,"temp":0,"max":170,"details":""},"ac":{"value":30,"details":"(26 when broken), construct armor"},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"mental","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":10,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"holy","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"hardness":{"value":10}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Animated by powerful fiends, necrosis engines are machines of death created with the expressed intent of exterminating living creatures. They siphon the souls of their prey, processing them into incorporeal coal that they burn to fuel their internal flames.</p><p>Necrosis engines imbue the wounds they inflict with festering energy from Hell that interferes with treatment. As such, they are often deployed to annihilate military bunkers that house clerics and other magical healers. Druids that have angered a high-ranking fiend might find a necrosis engine searing their forest and scorching their animals.</p><h2>Hell on Wheels</h2><p>Necrosis engines absorb the souls of the mortals they kill, burning them as fuel. However, most souls captured by a necrosis engine can combust for days or even weeks before being entirely consumed. Only once the engine's infernal creators summon it back to Hell to drain its reservoir of fuel is a soul captured by a necrosis engine well and truly lost.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light, medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, burning barbs, constitution, death, energy resistant (fire, spirit, vitality, void), fire, fire shield, metal, spirit, strength, sturdy, throwing, time, unholy, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Parker Stilwell","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":0},"con":{"mod":7},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":19,"senses":[{"type":"lifesense","acuity":"imprecise","range":120}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":22}},"traits":{"value":["construct","fiend","fire","mindless","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"_id":"wUPRdWzgRdi1nI6i","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/necrosis-engine.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Necrosis Engine","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":2,"height":2,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/necrosis-engine.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/necrosis-engine.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Construct Armor (Hardness 10)","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Like normal objects, a necrosis engine has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the necrosis engine takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once a necrosis engine is reduced to less than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, its construct armor breaks, removing the Hardness and reducing its Armor Class to 26.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.NPCAbility.ConstructArmor.CriticalHit","option":"construct-armor","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"selector":"ac","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hardness.value","phase":"afterDerived","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"value":0}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","duplicateSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"bagtOuDwz3D0lOK4"},{"type":"action","name":"Absorb Soul","syste