ce":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Flamethrower","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["brutal","fire","magical","range-increment-30","unholy"]},"damageRolls":{"DfGy6HYjXHH12aex":{"damage":"2d6+11","damageType":"fire","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":21},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"klZSLAx5763esi7w","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Fiendish Wound","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Injuries from a necrosis engine's necrotizing piston Strike fester with malevolent energy from Hell. Until the start of the necrosis engine's next turn, magically treating these wounds is particularly difficult. The malevolent energy attempts to counteract all magical effects that would restore Hit Points to the target (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+21 #Counteract]]{+21}).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"OkcBGUFWGkpuT6fR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Rev Engine","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The necrosis engine shifts into overdrive, releasing a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] of sparks and flames. Creatures in the cone take @Damage[5d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic] save). Creatures that fail their save are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} until the end of their next turn as sparks cover their eyes.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","fire","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Qhho53rJ3VkIV4np","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Soul Siphon","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The necrosis engine attempts to steal a portion of the souls surrounding it. All living creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:26] save. The necrosis engine can't use Soul Siphon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Soul Siphon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is doomed 1 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 4}. For 1 minute, the necrosis engine's necrotizing piston Strike gains a status bonus to its fire damage equal to twice the value of the highest drained condition Soul Siphon inflicted.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["death","divine","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"a5DPCf6BftPxVTcO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":5100000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}